  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.4.5: republication of 0.4.4, no native change. 0.4.4: the context follows the VIDEO MEMORY (AutoConfigurator reads the free VRAM of the GPU and reports MaxContextSize; ReserveContext refuses a KV cache that would spill into shared memory), LocalModel.GetMemoryBreakdown() and Warmup(); the PyPI wrapper catches up with 0.4.2-0.4.3. 0.4.3: loop stop — a reply that repeats the same tokens three times in a row ends by itself (no logit is touched, tool calls written as text are exempt; DESIREEIA_NO_LOOP_STOP=1 turns it off). DRY also suspends itself inside a tool call written as text. No API change (interface 6). Full notes: CHANGELOG.md in the repository.",
